description: API module patterns, endpoint constants, and env usage
globs: "src/lib/api/**/*.ts,src/lib/api/constants/**/*.ts,src/lib/config.ts,src/config.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# API layer

- Keep API calls in `src/lib/api/modules/*`; avoid fetch calls scattered in components.
- Declare reusable endpoint segments in `src/lib/api/constants/*` and keep module contracts typed.
- Base URLs must come from config/env (`src/config.ts`, `src/lib/config.ts`); never hardcode hosts.
- Use existing HTTP helpers (`src/lib/api/helpers/httpClient.ts`) for consistent auth, error handling, and list parsing.
